<article class="kh-collage-study">
<p class="kh-breadcrumb"><a href="/style-guide/design/">Design guide</a> / Study</p>
<h1>Fragments into a system</h1>
<p class="kh-collage-intro">A secondary image treatment, prompted by the supplied TurboGrafx-16 advertisement: cut-paper fragments, overlapping images and a strong black anchor on an open paper field. This is a study for project covers, not a replacement for the shared theme.</p>
<section class="kh-collage-cover" aria-labelledby="collage-project-title">
<div>
<p class="kh-meta">Art-direction study / UNDRR</p>
<h2 id="collage-project-title">One shared <span>truth.</span></h2>
<p>Brand rules and structured content connect working sites and designer Figma files.</p>
<a href="/work/2026/impact-story-mangrove-figma/">Read the actual project ↗</a>
</div>
<div class="kh-collage-stage">
<div class="kh-collage-shards" aria-hidden="true">
